{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TaterUp is a physics-based platformer where you play as an adorable potato desperately trying to avoid getting cooked!</strong><br>Your mission? Keep bouncing, keep climbing, and hop from object to object as you make your daring escape upwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From kitchen utensils to household items and all sorts of chaotic obstacles, the world is full of slippery slopes and hilarious surprises waiting to send you tumbling down. Play solo for the ultimate spud-challenge, or team up with friends in co-op for double the chaos (and double the laughs).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls that are easy to pick up but tricky to master, every attempt takes you a little higher\u2014closer to freedom, and further away from becoming someone\u2019s dinner!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989920?t=1757627893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989920/faaaae4815e5677e7bbc4573f55dc26642190b9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757627893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989920/ff8fd97ff5820f242f8f50b0dc09579463b40937/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757627893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989920/ff8fd97ff5820f242f8f50b0dc09579463b40937/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757627893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TaterUp is a physics-based platformer where you play as an adorable potato desperately trying to avoid getting cooked!</strong><br>Your mission? Keep bouncing, keep climbing, and hop from object to object as you make your daring escape upwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From kitchen utensils to household items and all sorts of chaotic obstacles, the world is full of slippery slopes and hilarious surprises waiting to send you tumbling down. Play solo for the ultimate spud-challenge, or team up with friends in co-op for double the chaos (and double the laughs).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls that are easy to pick up but tricky to master, every attempt takes you a little higher\u2014closer to freedom, and further away from becoming someone\u2019s dinner!</p>","developers":["Ash and Pause"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989920/a174eae23a1221e6d63618156a878f05f02f4fb7/header.jpg?t=1757627893","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3989920/1571060713/338675b251fa3f2df487362d9db52cd156ce94c8/1756242783/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757627891","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3989920/1571060713/338675b251fa3f2df487362d9db52cd156ce94c8/1756242783/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757627891","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3989920/1571060713/338675b251fa3f2df487362d9db52cd156ce94c8/1756242783/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757627891","id":257189333,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189333/movie480.mp4?t=1757627891","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189333/movie_max.mp4?t=1757627891"},"name":"Kost\u00fcm Partisi!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189333/f6694eaef247f38df9d6426e5d36f6b6b8136714/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757627891","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189333/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757627891","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189333/movie_max_vp9.webm